13. BeanFactory and ApplicationContext
They are both IOC containers to manage beans.
ApplicationContext is the default one, it have full features we can use.
BeanFactory is only for lightweight apps.

14. Bean scope?
Singleton. It is the bean default scope which means we just have one object, no matter where we inject the bean,
we only ues this single one object.
Prototype: Every time we inject the bean, a new object is created
